ragraph\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">Learn how we transformed abandoned animals&#8217; lives by providing care, rehabilitation, and adoption opportunities that change futures.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center ext-animate--on is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--image-1--content-left extendify-image-import is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--image-1--content-left--8\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/images.unsplash.com\/photo-1600600457585-570c2eb88b89?fit=crop&amp;crop=entropy%2Cfaces&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=1280\" alt=\"\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4\/3;object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-114ec22b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center ext-animate--on is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--image-1--content-right extendify-image-import is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--image-1--content-right--9\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/images.unsplash.com\/photo-1596075780750-81249df16d19?fit=crop&amp;crop=entropy%2Cfaces&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=1280\" alt=\"\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4\/3;object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center ext-animate--on is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading ext-animate--on\">Building a Compassionate Community Through Pet Care<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"ext-animate--on wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">See how we overcome challenges in animal rescue and foster lasting bonds between pets and their new families.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div clas